{"headword":"חָלַק","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>vb. divide, share (</strong>NH <em>id.;</em> Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲלַק</span> <em>field</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">חוּלְּקָא</span> <em>portion</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܚܠܰܩ</span> <em>divide, determine, decree;</em> Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">خَلَقَ</span> <em>measure, measure off;</em> Assyrian <em>eḳlu, possession, field</em>, Jäger<sup>BAS ii. 296</sup>; Ethiopic ኈለቈ: i. 2, is <em>enumerate</em>, ኍልቍ, ኊለቅ <em>enumeration, number</em><strong>)</strong>—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 4:19\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.4.19\">Dt 4:19</a> + 5 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">חָֽלְקוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 18:2\" href=\"/Joshua.18.2\">Jos 18:2</a>; Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יַחֲלֹק</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 27:17\" href=\"/Job.27.17\">Jb 27:17</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 17:2\" href=\"/Proverbs.17.2\">Pr 17:2</a>; 2 ms. sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">וַתַּחְלְקֵם</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 9:22\" href=\"/Nehemiah.9.22\">Ne 9:22</a>; 3 pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיַּחְלְקוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 14:5\" href=\"/Joshua.14.5\">Jos 14:5</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יַחֲלֹ֑קוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 30:24\" href=\"/I_Samuel.30.24\">1 S 30:24</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיַּחְלְקוּם</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 24:4\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.24.4\">1 Ch 24:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 24:5\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.24.5\">5</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">תַּחְלְקוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 19:30\" href=\"/II_Samuel.19.30\">2 S 19:30</a>; Imv. <span dir=\"rtl\">חִלְקוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 22:8\" href=\"/Joshua.22.8\">Jos 22:8</a>; Inf. <span dir=\"rtl\">לַחֲלֹק</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 13:13\" href=\"/Nehemiah.13.13\">Ne 13:13</a>; Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">חוֹלֵק</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 29:24\" href=\"/Proverbs.29.24\">Pr 29:24</a>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>divide, apportion</em>, sq. acc. (of gods) and <span dir=\"rtl\">לְ</span> pers. <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 4:19\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.4.19\">Dt 4:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 29:25\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.29.25\">29:25</a>; acc. not expressed <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 13:13\" href=\"/Nehemiah.13.13\">Ne 13:13</a> (ref. to offerings and tithes); c. acc. (of land) <a data-ref=\"Joshua 14:5\" href=\"/Joshua.14.5\">Jos 14:5</a> (P), <a data-ref=\"Joshua 18:2\" href=\"/Joshua.18.2\">18:2</a> (JE), <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 19:30\" href=\"/II_Samuel.19.30\">2 S 19:30</a>: obj. people <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 9:22\" href=\"/Nehemiah.9.22\">Ne 9:22</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ עִם</span> <em>divide with</em> others <a data-ref=\"Joshua 22:8\" href=\"/Joshua.22.8\">Jos 22:8</a> (D?)."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>assign, distribute:</em> Levites over <span dir=\"rtl\">(על)</span> temple <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 23:18\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.23.18\">2 Ch 23:18</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 24:4\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.24.4\">1 Ch 24:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 24:5\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.24.5\">5</a>."}],"num":"2."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>assign, impart</em>, sq. <span dir=\"rtl\">בַּבִּינָה</span> & <span dir=\"rtl\">לְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 39:17\" href=\"/Job.39.17\">Jb 39:17</a>."}],"num":"3."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>share</em> (in), sq. acc. silver <a data-ref=\"Job 27:17\" href=\"/Job.27.17\">Jb 27:17</a>; inheritance <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 17:2\" href=\"/Proverbs.17.2\">Pr 17:2</a>; spoil <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 30:24\" href=\"/I_Samuel.30.24\">1 S 30:24</a> (obj. om.); sq. <span dir=\"rtl\">עם</span> <em>have shares with</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ עם גַּנָּב</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 29:24\" href=\"/Proverbs.29.24\">Pr 29:24</a>."}],"num":"4."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>divide up</em> = <em>plunder</em> the temple, sq. acc. <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 28:21\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.28.21\">2 Ch 28:21</a> (v. Be)."}],"num":"5."}],"form":"Qal"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יֵחָלֵק</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 26:55\" href=\"/Numbers.26.55\">Nu 26:55</a> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 16:21\" href=\"/I_Kings.16.21\">1 K 16:21</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יֵחָ֫לֶק</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 38:24\" href=\"/Job.38.24\">Jb 38:24</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיֵּחָלֵק</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 14:15\" href=\"/Genesis.14.15\">Gn 14:15</a>; 3 fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">תֵּחָלֵק</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 26:53\" href=\"/Numbers.26.53\">Nu 26:53</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 26:56\" href=\"/Numbers.26.56\">26:56</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיֶּֽחָלְקֵם</span> (Baer) <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 23:6\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.23.6\">1 Ch 23:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 24:3\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.24.3\">24:3</a> cf. Be & infr. sub <strong>Pi.</strong>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"reflex., <em>divide oneself</em> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 14:15\" href=\"/Genesis.14.15\">Gn 14:15</a> (i.e. one’s men)."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"pass. <em>be divided:</em>"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>apportioned</em>, the land <a data-ref=\"Numbers 26:53\" href=\"/Numbers.26.53\">Nu 26:53</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 26:55\" href=\"/Numbers.26.55\">55</a> (by lot) v <a data-ref=\"Numbers 26:56\" href=\"/Numbers.26.56\">56</a> (<em>id.</em>); all P."}],"num":"a."},{"senses":[{"definition":"of people, <em>divided into</em> two factions <a data-ref=\"I Kings 16:21\" href=\"/I_Kings.16.21\">1 K 16:21</a>."}],"num":"b."},{"senses":[{"definition":"of light, <em>parted, spread abroad</em> <a data-ref=\"Job 38:24\" href=\"/Job.38.24\">Jb 38:24</a>."}],"num":"c."}],"num":"2."},{"senses":[{"definition":"trans. <em>assign, distribute</em> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 23:6\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.23.6\">1 Ch 23:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 24:3\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.24.3\">24:3</a>, but trans. Niph. is unlikely, v. infr."}],"num":"3."}],"form":"Niph."},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. 3 pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">חִלֵּקוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Joel 4:2\" href=\"/Joel.4.2\">Jo 4:2</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וְחִלַּקְתֶּם</span> consec. <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 47:21\" href=\"/Ezekiel.47.21\">Ez 47:21</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">חִלְּקָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 4:16\" href=\"/Lamentations.4.16\">La 4:16</a>; 3 fs. sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">חִלְּקַ֫תָּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 34:17\" href=\"/Isaiah.34.17\">Is 34:17</a>; 2 ms. sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">וְחִלַּקְתָּם</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 5:1\" href=\"/Exodus.5.1\">Ex 5:1</a>;—Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יְחַלֵּק</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 49:27\" href=\"/Genesis.49.27\">Gn 49:27</a> + 4 times, etc.; prob. read <span dir=\"rtl\">יְחַלְּקֵם</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 23:6\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.23.6\">1 Ch 23:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 24:3\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.24.3\">24:3</a> (v. supr. <strong>Niph.</strong>), etc.; Imv. <span dir=\"rtl\">חַלֵּק</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 13:7\" href=\"/Joshua.13.7\">Jos 13:7</a>; Inf. <span dir=\"rtl\">חַלֵּק</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 19:51\" href=\"/Joshua.19.51\">Jos 19:51</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 16:19\" href=\"/Proverbs.16.19\">Pr 16:19</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">חַלְּקָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 9:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.9.2\">Is 9:2</a>—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>divide, apportion:</em> food, at festival <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 6:19\" href=\"/II_Samuel.6.19\">2 S 6:19</a>, sq. acc. & <span dir=\"rtl\">לְ</span> = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 16:3\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.16.3\">1 Ch 16:3</a>, garments <a data-ref=\"Psalms 22:19\" href=\"/Psalms.22.19\">ψ 22:19</a>, sorrows <a data-ref=\"Job 21:17\" href=\"/Job.21.17\">Jb 21:17</a> (no <span dir=\"rtl\">לְ</span>); <em>give a portion to</em>, sq. <span dir=\"rtl\">לְ</span> (no acc. expr.) <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 53:12\" href=\"/Isaiah.53.12\">Is 53:12</a>; a land <a data-ref=\"Joel 4:2\" href=\"/Joel.4.2\">Jo 4:2</a> (no ind. obj.) <a data-ref=\"Joshua 19:51\" href=\"/Joshua.19.51\">Jos 19:51</a> (P), also <a data-ref=\"Micah 2:4\" href=\"/Micah.2.4\">Mi 2:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 60:8\" href=\"/Psalms.60.8\">ψ 60:8</a> = <a data-ref=\"Psalms 108:8\" href=\"/Psalms.108.8\">108:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 11:39\" href=\"/Daniel.11.39\">Dn 11:39</a>; sq. acc. & <span dir=\"rtl\">לְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 13:7\" href=\"/Joshua.13.7\">Jos 13:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 18:10\" href=\"/Joshua.18.10\">18:10</a> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 18:6\" href=\"/I_Kings.18.6\">1 K 18:6</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 34:17\" href=\"/Isaiah.34.17\">Is 34:17</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 47:21\" href=\"/Ezekiel.47.21\">Ez 47:21</a>; <em>divide</em> hair (symbol.) <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 5:1\" href=\"/Ezekiel.5.1\">Ez 5:1</a>; <em>divide</em> spoil <span dir=\"rtl\">(שָׁלָל)</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 9:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.9.2\">Is 9:2</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 16:19\" href=\"/Proverbs.16.19\">Pr 16:19</a> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 49:27\" href=\"/Genesis.49.27\">Gn 49:27</a> (poem), <a data-ref=\"Exodus 15:9\" href=\"/Exodus.15.9\">Ex 15:9</a> (song); <a data-ref=\"Judges 5:30\" href=\"/Judges.5.30\">Ju 5:30</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 68:13\" href=\"/Psalms.68.13\">ψ 68:13</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 53:12\" href=\"/Isaiah.53.12\">Is 53:12</a>."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>assign, distribute:</em> Levites to their service, prob. <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 23:6\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.23.6\">1 Ch 23:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 24:3\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.24.3\">24:3</a> (v. supr.)"}],"num":"2."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>scatter</em>, sq. acc. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 49:7\" href=\"/Genesis.49.7\">Gn 49:7</a> (poem) (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">הפיץ</span>), <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 4:16\" href=\"/Lamentations.4.16\">La 4:16</a>."}],"num":"3."}],"form":"Pi."},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. <span dir=\"rtl\">חֻלַּק</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 33:23\" href=\"/Isaiah.33.23\">Is 33:23</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וְחֻלַּק</span> consec. <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 14:1\" href=\"/Zechariah.14.1\">Zc 14:1</a>; Impf. 3 fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּחֻלָּ֑ק</span> <a data-ref=\"Amos 7:17\" href=\"/Amos.7.17\">Am 7:17</a>; <em>be divided</em>, of land <a data-ref=\"Amos 7:17\" href=\"/Amos.7.17\">Am 7:17</a>; spoil <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 33:23\" href=\"/Isaiah.33.23\">Is 33:23</a> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 14:1\" href=\"/Zechariah.14.1\">Zc 14:1</a>."}],"form":"Pu."},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. <span dir=\"rtl\">וְהִתְחַלְּקוּ</span> consec. <a data-ref=\"Joshua 18:5\" href=\"/Joshua.18.5\">Jos 18:5</a> <em>divide</em> (land) <em>among themselves</em>."}],"form":"Hithp."},{"senses":[{"definition":"Inf. <span dir=\"rtl\">לַחֲלִק</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 37:12\" href=\"/Jeremiah.37.12\">Je 37:12</a>; <em>to receive a portion</em> (denom. from <span dir=\"rtl\">חֵלֶק</span>), but dub."}],"form":"Hiph."}]},"rid":"BDB03130","strong_numbers":["2505"],"next_hw":"חֵ֫לֶק","prev_hw":"חֵ֫לֶץ","all_cited":true,"ordinal":"I.","root":true,"quotes":[],"GK":["2744","2745","2746"],"TWOT":["669","670"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906","version_lang":"en","should_autocomplete":true}}